Terry: This is our last meeting, you are now free to explore the rest of prototype
Terry: One last tip if you are on the ground, if you hold ALT + w or s you can look up and down.  
Terry: Enjoy the rest of the prototype friend, don't forget to document bugs you find, any pros and cons as well.
Terry: There will be a channel for bug reports, just drop those there.
